{
  "name": "Tickets Esquecidos",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "duplicateItem": false,
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "b9ef5426-7e79-4967-b60d-b35e89c0e025",
              "name": "OPA_BASE_URL",
              "value": "https://atendimento.viponline.net.br/api/v1",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6fa1ab98-e761-4431-8f9b-9d839ee2d90b",
      "name": "Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -200,
        300
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "Edit the values here with your actual URLs, API keys, and workflow IDs"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⏰ Sub-Workflow: Tickets Esquecidos\n\n**Trigger:** Cron (a cada 5 minutos)\n\n**Fluxo:**\n1. Busca atendimentos no setor Bot com status EA (Em Atendimento)\n2. Filtra tickets sem resposta há mais de 10 minutos\n3. Envia lembrete ao cliente\n4. Se sem resposta há 30+ minutos, encerra atendimento\n5. Envia alerta aos admins sobre tickets abandonados",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "13139380-1de6-49a6-b5b8-905ddd5cb7e5",
      "name": "Info Tickets Esquecidos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "356a70aa-3c7d-4493-ae00-e8bea3353c67",
      "name": "Cron - Every 5 Min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        300,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.OPA_BASE_URL }}/atendimento",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ setor: '5d1623f35e74a002308aa25d', status: 'EA' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "6ca2e0b4-7f71-4f3a-a0ef-1a3a773ed854",
      "name": "OPA - List Bot Tickets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Filter stale tickets\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst tickets = response.data || response || [];\nconst ticketsArray = Array.isArray(tickets) ? tickets : [];\n\nconst now = Date.now();\nconst TEN_MIN = 10 * 60 * 1000;\nconst THIRTY_MIN = 30 * 60 * 1000;\n\nconst stale = [];\nconst abandoned = [];\n\nfor (const ticket of ticketsArray) {\n  const lastActivity = new Date(ticket.updatedAt || ticket.data_atualizacao || ticket.createdAt).getTime();\n  const elapsed = now - lastActivity;\n\n  if (elapsed >= THIRTY_MIN) {\n    abandoned.push({ ...ticket, elapsed, action: 'close' });\n  } else if (elapsed >= TEN_MIN) {\n    stale.push({ ...ticket, elapsed, action: 'remind' });\n  }\n}\n\nif (stale.length === 0 && abandoned.length === 0) {\n  return []; // Nothing to do\n}\n\nreturn [{ json: { stale, abandoned, totalStale: stale.length, totalAbandoned: abandoned.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "14266340-354c-416f-8b4e-5cb98b850869",
      "name": "Filter Stale Tickets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Process stale tickets: send reminders\nconst data = $input.first().json;\nconst items = [];\n\nfor (const ticket of data.stale) {\n  items.push({\n    json: {\n      customerServiceId: ticket._id || ticket.id,\n      text: 'Oi! Ainda estou por aqui 😊 Precisa de algo mais?',\n      action: 'remind'\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nfor (const ticket of data.abandoned) {\n  items.push({\n    json: {\n      customerServiceId: ticket._id || ticket.id,\n      text: 'Como não recebi resposta, vou encerrar nosso atendimento por aqui. Se precisar, é só chamar novamente! 😊',\n      action: 'close'\n    }\n  });\n}\n\nreturn items;"
      },
      "id": "4144089d-ce90-48ce-9bca-4d85d8ced16b",
      "name": "Prepare Actions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1
      },
      "id": "101c1c47-9ec5-49c9-9a43-c7a24e729fe1",
      "name": "Loop Stale Actions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1180,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.OPA_BASE_URL }}/atendimento/mensagem/send",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ customerServiceId: $json.customerServiceId, content: { type: 'text', text: $json.text } }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "97877487-f6c1-4724-9bd2-644d969021da",
      "name": "OPA - Send Reminder/Close",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1400,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "leftValue": ""
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.action }}",
              "rightValue": "close",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "aeba996b-51ad-4b0c-8794-2f1ce1de8ac2",
      "name": "Is Close Action?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1620,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Config').first().json.OPA_BASE_URL }}/atendimento/{{ $json.customerServiceId }}/observacao",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: '[Bot] Atendimento encerrado automaticamente por inatividade (30+ min sem resposta)' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "02593f06-4ae3-4166-9985-d881cc6b5fa0",
      "name": "OPA - Close Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1840,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Clean up session for closed ticket\nconst staticData = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nif (staticData.sessions) {\n  delete staticData.sessions[$json.customerServiceId];\n}\nreturn [{ json: $json }];"
      },
      "id": "aa4f2a3b-0d62-4c10-a1dc-e11e456cb2d5",
      "name": "Cleanup Session",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2060,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Continue loop\nreturn [{ json: $json }];"
      },
      "id": "152dffb4-4b66-4794-b71d-04e64ac96a7b",
      "name": "Continue Loop",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1840,
        400
      ]
    }
  ],
